ribbitOS builds on work by others.

- robotOS / r1ptt (https://github.com/windoze95/robotOS), at commit 20bd8f9, the last version
  with OpenClaw support. Adapted here: app/src/main/java/dev/ribbitos/lite/net/Sse.kt (from
  net/Sse.kt), tools/lib.sh and tools/flash-gsi.sh, plus the OpenClaw chat-completions approach
  (only the new message is sent; `user` keys the gateway session). Under the MIT license:

